         "Draw the boxes before explaining — interviewers follow diagrams better than monologues. The three sentences to land: UI never touches the network, Room is the source of truth, RemoteMediator bridges network and database. Every follow-up (offline? images? scale?) maps to one box, which is why the diagram carries the answer.",
